                dst_name <span class="token operator">=</span> file_entry<span class="token punctuation">.</span>get<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"dest"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> file_entry<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">"src"</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre></div></div> <div class="paragraph" dir="auto">This also assumes <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">file_entry</code> is either str or dict, and would crash similarly. I should normalize there too, or better yet, normalize once in <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate_primitive</code> and ensure <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">build_primitive</code> receives clean data. But <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">build_primitive</code> reads from <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">spec</code> directly, not from <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate_primitive</code>'s result.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Actually, I should probably create a helper method to normalize and validate file entries, or at least normalize <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">spec["files"]</code> in both places.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Let me provide a comprehensive fix.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----><!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The crash happens because <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">spec["files"]</code> in the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">grasp</code> primitive is <strong>not a list</strong> — it's likely a bare string or a single dict, so iterating over it yields individual characters or dict-keys instead of proper file-entry items.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">I need to make <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate_primitive</code> (and <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">build_primitive</code>) robust against malformed <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">files</code> values. Here's the fixed file:</div></div></div><div data-v-004597db="" class="container-block"><div data-v-004597db="" class="block-item"><div data-v-d664c8c3=""><div data-v-863d6f1b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="toolcall-container default toolcall-ipython"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" data-v-863d6f1b="" class="toolcall-title-container default"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name line"><svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-name-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Code"><path d="M705.28 642.56a35.541333 35.541333 0 0 1 0 70.741333l-3.669333 0.170667H512a35.541333 35.541333 0 0 1 0-71.082667h189.610667l3.626666 0.170667zM297.216 320.938667a35.584 35.584 0 0 1 47.573333-2.432l2.730667 2.432 114.261333 114.261333a75.093333 75.093333 0 0 1 0 106.197333l-114.261333 114.261334-2.730667 2.474666a35.584 35.584 0 0 1-50.005333-50.048l2.432-2.730666 114.304-114.261334a3.968 3.968 0 0 0 0-5.589333L297.173333 371.2a35.584 35.584 0 0 1 0-50.261333z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M725.333333 132.266667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 891.733333 298.666667v426.666666a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4H298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 725.333333V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h426.666666zM298.666667 209.066667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v426.666666c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h426.666666a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6V298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 209.066667H298.666667z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name-text">Execute Python code</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Right_b"><path d="M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-751082f0="" data-v-863d6f1b="" class="ipython-images-container"><!----></div></div></div></div><div data-v-004597db="" class="block-item"><div data-v-56fb9f7a="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="toolcall-container thinking-container block-container" share-mode="false"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="toolcall-title-container default"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name line"><svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-name-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Dot"><path d="M512 384a128 128 0 1 1 0 256 128 128 0 0 1 0-256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name-text">Fix build_zoo.py: Handle missing src keys and correct dict checks</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Right_b"><path d="M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-9445e104="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="toolcall-content"><div data-v-9445e104="" class="resize-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-9445e104="" class="slot-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The user had a crash in build_zoo.py when processing the "grasp" primitive. The error was <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">TypeError: string indices must be integers, not 'str'</code> at <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">file_entry["src"]</code>, meaning <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">file_entry</code> was a string but the code expected a dict.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">I provided a fixed version of the file that:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Added a <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">_normalize_files()</code> helper to wrap bare strings or single dicts into a list</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Made <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate_primitive</code> normalize <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">spec["files"]</code> before iterating, and also guard against missing <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">"src"</code> keys in dict entries</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Made <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">build_primitive</code> use <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">elif isinstance(file_entry, dict)</code> instead of <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">else</code> to avoid assuming dict when it's not</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Stored the normalized files back onto <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">spec</code> so <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">build_primitive</code> receives clean data</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">I saved the file to <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">/mnt/agents/output/build_zoo.py</code> and should provide it as a download link, plus explain what was wrong.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The user hasn't asked a new question - they just provided the error output. I already ran the ipython tool to generate the fixed file. Now I need to present the result clearly.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----><!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The crash was caused by a malformed <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">files</code> field in the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">grasp</code> primitive's <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">spec.yaml</code>.<br>If <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">files</code> is written as a bare string or a single dict (instead of a list), iterating over it yields individual characters or dict-keys — and when the code later does <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">file_entry["src"]</code> on a string, Python explodes.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">I added a <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">_normalize_files()</code> helper and hardened both <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate_primitive</code> and <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">build_primitive</code> so they tolerate:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">files: grasp.py</code> → wrapped into <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">[grasp.py]</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">files: {src: grasp.py, dest: index.html}</code> → wrapped into <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">[{src: ..., dest: ...}]</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Missing <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">"src"</code> key in a dict entry → clean validation error instead of <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">KeyError</code></div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Here is the fixed file:<br><strong><a data-v-3b9ae98b="" target="_blank" href="sandbox:///mnt/agents/output/build_zoo.py" rel="noreferrer nofollow noopener">build_zoo.py</a></strong></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Key changes:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">Python</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-python"><code class="language-python"><span class="token keyword">def</span> <span class="token function">_normalize_files</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>files_raw<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token builtin">isinstance</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>files_raw<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token builtin">str</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>files_raw<span class="token punctuation">]</span>
    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token builtin">isinstance</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>files_raw<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token builtin">dict</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>files_raw<span class="token punctuation">]</span>
    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token builtin">isinstance</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>files_raw<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token builtin">list</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token keyword">return</span> files_raw
    <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span></code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">And in <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate_primitive</code>:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">Python</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-python"><code class="language-python">files <span class="token operator">=</span> _normalize_files<span class="token punctuation">(</span>spec<span class="token punctuation">.</span>get<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"files"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
<span class="token comment"># ...</span>
<span class="token keyword">for</span> file_entry <span class="token keyword">in</span> files<span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token builtin">isinstance</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>file_entry<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token builtin">str</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>
    <span class="token keyword">elif</span> <span class="token builtin">isinstance</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>file_entry<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token builtin">dict</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token string">"src"</span> <span class="token keyword">not</span> <span class="token keyword">in</span> file_entry<span class="token punctuation">:</span>
            self<span class="token punctuation">.</span>errors<span class="token punctuation">.</span>append<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string-interpolation"><span class="token string">f"</span><span class="token interpolation"><span class="token punctuation">{</span>name<span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><span class="token string">: File entry dict missing 'src' key"</span></span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
