v-255.445333a106.666667 106.666667 0 0 0 71.125333-100.096 35.584 35.584 0 1 0-71.125333 0 35.584 35.584 0 0 1-71.082667 0 35.584 35.584 0 1 0-71.125333 0 106.666667 106.666667 0 0 0 71.125333 100.096V725.333333h-47.018667a307.029333 307.029333 0 0 0-87.04-137.984 248.874667 248.874667 0 0 1 169.941334-430.933333 246.101333 246.101333 0 0 1 165.376 63.232 248.661333 248.661333 0 0 1-1.706667 372.693333h-0.085333z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name-text">Refactor NL to Motion Transformer for Clean Code and Logging</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Right_b"><path d="M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-9445e104="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="toolcall-content"><div data-v-9445e104="" class="resize-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-9445e104="" class="slot-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The user wants a "production grade init.py" for their SkillPrimitives project. Based on the context so far:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">This is a robotics NL-to-motion transformer project</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">It has primitives (skills) organized in directories with <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">spec.yaml</code> files</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">There's a <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">build_zoo.py</code> that compiles these into a <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">zoo/</code> directory</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">base</code> primitive is an abstract base class for manipulation primitives</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">There are scripts: <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">annotate</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">compose</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">demo</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">They want an <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">init.py</code> - likely the package initialization file for <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">skill_primitives/</code> or the root package</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Given the project structure inferred:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">skill_primitives/primitives/</code> - individual primitive directories</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">zoo/</code> - compiled output</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">script/build_zoo.py</code> - build tool</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">templates/</code> - jinja2 templates</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">A production-grade <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">__init__.py</code> (I assume they mean <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">__init__.py</code> for the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">skill_primitives</code> package, not a standalone <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">init.py</code>) should:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Define the package version</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Expose key classes/interfaces (like the base primitive class)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Set up logging properly</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Handle imports gracefully with <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">__all__</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Maybe provide a registry/discovery mechanism</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Include type hints</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Be formatted for black/ruff compliance</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Handle optional dependencies gracefully</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Wait, they said "init.py" not "<strong>init</strong>.py". But in Python package context, it's almost certainly <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">__init__.py</code>. However, looking at the project structure, they might want an initialization script. But given "production grade", it's likely the package <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">__init__.py</code> for <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">skill_primitives</code>.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Let me think about what should be in it:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13f