<span class="token decorator annotation punctuation">@dataclass</span>
<span class="token keyword">class</span> <span class="token class-name">Trajectory</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token triple-quoted-string string">"""Result returned by :meth:`Primitive.execute`.

