        <span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Where it goes:</strong> <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">skill_primitives/primitives/base/base.py</code></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Design decisions for the NL→motion pipeline:</strong></div><div data-v-01af594f="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="table markdown-table"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-01af594f="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions"><div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions-content"><span data-v-01af594f="" class="table-title">Table</span> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-01af594f=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span> <div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-01af594f="" class="icon-button table-actions-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Download"><path d="M512 126.976a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v347.91424l119.11168-119.11168a36.864 36.864 0 1 1 52.14208 52.14208l-182.0672 182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1-52.10112 0l-182.0672-182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 52.14208-52.14208l119.11168 119.11168V163.84a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864zM184.32 564.71552a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v145.65376a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288 35.96288h509.70624a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288-35.96288v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 73.728 0v145.65376a109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1-109.69088 109.69088H257.14688A109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1 147.456 747.23328v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-container"><table data-v-01af594f=""><thead data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Feature</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Why it matters</th></tr></thead> <tbody data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f=""><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">RobotState</code> (frozen dataclass)</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Immutable snapshots let <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate</code> check preconditions without side effects. Used by your <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate</code> script.</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f=""><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Trajectory</code> (dataclass)</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Standard return shape from <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">execute</code>. <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">success</code> + <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">error_message</code> let the transformer or <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">demo</code> script handle failures gracefully.</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f=""><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">parameters_schema</code> (ClassVar)</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">The transformer can introspect what arguments a primitive needs (e.g. <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">target_position</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">approach_offset</code>) to generate them from natural language.</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f=""><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">_validate_and_coerce</code></strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Enforces the schema at runtime, applies defaults, and raises on missing required params. Prevents silent failures during <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">compose</code>.</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f=""><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate(state)</code> abstract</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Your <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">validate</code> script can call this on a composed chain before execution.</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f=""><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">execute(robot_interface)</code> abstract</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Your <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">demo</code> script calls this. The <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">robot_interface</code> arg keeps the primitive agnostic to ROS2 / Isaac Sim / real hardware.</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f=""><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">to_dict</code> / <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">from_dict</code></strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">compose</code> can serialize a full skill chain to JSON for replay, logging, or training data generation.</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f=""><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">get_metadata</code> classmethod</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">build_zoo.py</code> can call this to auto-generate richer <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">spec.yaml</code> entries from the code itself.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Example concrete primitive:</strong></div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">Python</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-python"><code class="language-python"><span class="token keyword">from</span> base <span class="token keyword">import</span> Primitive<span class="token punctuation">,</span> RobotState<span class="token punctuation">,</span> Trajectory

<span class="token keyword">class</span> <span class="token class-name">Grasp</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>Primitive<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
