-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The user wants the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">__init__.py</code> file that goes inside the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">base</code> primitive folder (i.e., <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">skill_primitives/primitives/base/__init__.py</code>), not the package-level <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">__init__.py</code> that goes inside <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">skill_primitives/</code>.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">This is the entry point for the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">base</code> primitive module. It should:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Expose the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Primitive</code> base class</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Expose <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">RobotState</code> and <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Trajectory</code> data structures</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Be clean, minimal, and importable by other primitives that depend on <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">base</code></div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Let me write a production-grade <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">__init__.py</code> for the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">base</code> primitive folder.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----><!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Here is the <code data-