<span class="token keyword">class</span> <span class="token class-name">Primitive</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>ABC<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token triple-quoted-string string">"""Base class for robotics skill annotation primitives.

