"token operator">&gt;</span> <span class="token builtin">bool</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token keyword">not</span> <span class="token builtin">super</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>validate<span class="token punctuation">(</span>segment<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token boolean">False</span>

    duration <span class="token operator">=</span> segment<span class="token punctuation">.</span>get<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"end"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">-</span> segment<span class="token punctuation">.</span>get<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"start"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
    <span class="token keyword">if</span> duration <span class="token operator">&lt;=</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>
        <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token boolean">False</span>

    confidence <span class="token operator">=</span> segment<span class="token punctuation">.</span>get<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"confidence"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">0.0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
    <span class="token keyword">return</span> confidence <span class="token operator">&gt;=</span> self<span class="token punctuation">.</span>CONFIDENCE_LOW</code></pre></div></div> <div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">segment.get("confidence", 0.0)</code> returns <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code> because <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">segment</code> is <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">dict[str, Any]</code>. When <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">confidence</code> is <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code>, the comparison <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">confidence &gt;= self.CONFIDENCE_LOW</code> also returns <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code>, and mypy complains about returning <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code> from a function declared to return <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">bool</code>.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The fix is to explicitly cast or annotate the confidence value. I can use <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">typing.cast</code> or just assign with a type annotation, or better yet, use <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">float()</code> coercion.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Actually, the simplest fix is:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">Python</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-python"><code class="language-python">confidence<span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token builtin">float</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> segment<span class="token punctuation">.</span>get<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"confidence"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">0.0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre></div></div> <div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Or even simpler, since <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">get</code> with a default of <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">0.0</code> should logically return a float, but mypy sees it as <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code> because the dict value type is <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code>.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Let me provide the fixed file. I should also check if there are other similar issues in the file that might pop up.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Line 101 is likely the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">return confidence &gt;= self.CONFIDENCE_LOW</code> line.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Fix options:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">confidence = float(segment.get("confidence", 0.0))</code> - runtime coercion + mypy knows it's float</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">confidence: float = segment.get("confidence", 0.0)</code> - explicit annotation</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">from typing import cast; confidence = cast(float, segment.get("confidence", 0.0))</code></div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Option 1 is cleanest and also provides runtime safety.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----><!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code> return comes from <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">segment.get("confidence", 0.0)</code> — since <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">segment</code> is <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">dict[str, Any]</code>, mypy sees <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">confidence</code> as <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code>, and the comparison <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">&gt;=</code> returns <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code> instead of <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">bool</code>.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Fix: explicitly cast to <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">float</code>:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">Python</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 