b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-python"><code class="language-python"><span class="token comment"># Before (mypy error: Returning Any from function declared to return "bool")</span>
confidence <span class="token operator">=</span> segment<span class="token punctuation">.</span>get<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"confidence"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">0.0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
<span class="token keyword">return</span> confidence <span class="token operator">&gt;=</span> self<span class="token punctuation">.</span>CONFIDENCE_LOW

<span class="token comment"># After</span>
confidence <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token builtin">float</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>segment<span class="token punctuation">.</span>get<span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"confidence"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">0.0</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
<span class="token keyword">return</span> confidence <span class="token operator">&gt;=</span> self<span class="token punctuation">.</span>CONFIDENCE_LOW</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Since <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">segment: dict[str, Any]</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">segment.get(...)</code> returns <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code>. The comparison <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any &gt;= float</code> produces <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code>, which mypy rejects as the return value of a <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">bool</code> function. Wrapping with <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">float()</code> gives mypy a concrete type and provides runtime safety if someone stores a non-numeric value in the dict.</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-b1950b46="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0