3 0 0 0-87.04-137.984 248.874667 248.874667 0 0 1 169.941334-430.933333 246.101333 246.101333 0 0 1 165.376 63.232 248.661333 248.661333 0 0 1-1.706667 372.693333h-0.085333z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name-text">Type hinting np.linalg.norm return type in mypy</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Right_b"><path d="M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-9445e104="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="toolcall-content"><div data-v-9445e104="" class="resize-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-9445e104="" class="slot-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The mypy errors are at lines 103 and 106 in reach.py, which are the <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.linalg.norm</code> calls inside <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">_compute_speed</code>. The issue is that <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.linalg.norm</code> returns <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code> when called with <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">axis=1</code> on an <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.ndarray</code> of type <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Any</code> (since <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">state</code> and <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">velocity</code> are <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.ndarray | None</code>, and after the None checks, they're still <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.ndarray</code> without a more specific dtype/shape type).</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The fix is to cast the return values explicitly to <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.ndarray</code> or use a type annotation on the local variable. Since <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.linalg.norm</code> on a 2D array with axis=1 returns a 1D array, I can wrap it with <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.asarray(..., dtype=float)</code> or just assign to a typed local variable.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Actually, looking at the code:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">Python</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-python"><code class="language-python"><span class="token keyword">if</span> velocity <span class="token keyword">is</span> <span class="token keyword">not</span> <span class="token boolean">None</span> <span class="token keyword">and</span> velocity<span class="token punctuation">.</span>ndim <span class="token operator">==</span> <span class="token number">2</span> <span class="token keyword">and</span> velocity<span class="token punctuation">.</span>shape<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">==</span> n<span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    <span class="token keyword">return</span> np<span class="token punctuation">.</span>linalg<span class="token punctuation">.</span>norm<span class="token punctuation">(</span>velocity<span class="token punctuation">,</span> axis<span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
<span class="token keyword">if</span> state <span class="token keyword">is</span> <span class="token keyword">not</span> <span class="token boolean">None</span> <span class="token keyword">and</span> state<span class="token punctuation">.</span>ndim <span class="token operator">==</span> <span class="token number">2</span> <span class="token keyword">and</span> state<span class="token punctuation">.</span>shape<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token operator">==</span> n<span class="token punctuation">:</span>
    deltas <span class="token operator">=</span> np<span class="token punctuation">.</span>diff<span class="token punctuation">(</span>state<span class="token punctuation">,</span> axis<span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> prepend<span class="token operator">=</span>state<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
    <span class="token keyword">return</span> np<span class="token punctuation">.</span>linalg<span class="token punctuation">.</span>norm<span class="token punctuation">(</span>deltas<span class="token punctuation">,</span> axis<span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre></div></div> <div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The issue is that <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.linalg.norm</code> is overloaded and mypy can't resolve the return type when the input is <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">np.ndarray</code> (which is generic). The cleanest fix is to cast:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">Python</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-python"><code class="language-python"><span class="token keyword">return</span> np<span class="token punctuation">.</span>asarray<span class="token punctuation">(</span>np<span class="token punctuation">.</span>linalg<span class="token punctuation">.</span>norm<span class="token punctuation">(</span>velocity<span class="token punctuation">,</span> axis<span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> dtype<span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token builtin">float</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span></code></pre></div></div> <div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Or:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">Python</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-python"><code class="language-python">speed<span class="token punctuation">:</span> np<span class="token punctuation">.</span>ndarray <span class="token operator">=</span> np<span class="token punctuation">.</span>linalg<span class="token punctuation">.</span>norm<span class="token punctuation">(</span>velocity<span class="token punctuation">,</span> axis<span class="token operator">=</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
<span class="token keyword">return</span> speed</code></pre></div></div> <div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The explicit annotation approach is cleaner. Let me regenerate the file.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----><!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">plain</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">The `np.linalg.norm` calls return `Any` because mypy can't resolve the overload when the input is a generic `np.ndarray`. Fix: assign to an explicitly typed local variable.</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Here's the corrected <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">reach.py</code>:</div></div></div><div data-v-004597db="" class="container-block"><div data-v-004597db="" class="block-item"><div data-v-d664c8c3=""><div data-v-863d6f1b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="toolcall-container default toolcall-ipython"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" data-v-863d6f1b="" class="toolcall-title-container default"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name line"><svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-name-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Code"><path d="M705.28 642.56a35.541333 35.541333 0 0 1 0 70.741333l-3.669333 0.170667H512a35.541333 35.541333 0 0 1 0-71.082667h189.610667l3.626666 0.170667zM297.216 320.938667a35.584 35.584 0 0 1 47.573333-2.432l2.730667 2.432 114.261333 114.261333a75.093333 75.093333 0 0 1 0 106.197333l-114.261333 114.261334-2.730667 2.474666a35.584 35.584 0 0 1-50.005333-50.048l2.432-2.730666 114.304-114.261334a3.968 3.968 0 0 0 0-5.589333L297.173333 371.2a35.584 35.584 0 0 1 0-50.261333z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M725.333333 132.266667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 891.733333 298.666667v426.666666a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4H298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 725.333333V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h426.666666zM298.666667 209.0