"" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The user wants the transport primitive (transport.py, spec.yaml, <strong>init</strong>.py) following the same pattern as reach, grasp, lift, place.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Transport is the motion between two locations while holding an object — gripper closed, sustained motion. It's essentially "move while holding".</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Pattern:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">gripper stays closed (&lt; 0.5)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">sustained motion (speed &gt; threshold)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">longer duration than lift (transport is the carry phase)</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Files to generate:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">transport.py</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">spec_transport.yaml</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">__init__transport.py</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Let me generate all three.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----><!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"></div></div><div data-v-004597db="" class="container-block"><div data-v-004597db="" class="block-item"><div data-v-d664c8c3=""><div data-v-863d6f1b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="toolcall-container default toolcall-ipython"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" data-v-863d6f1b="" class="toolcall-title-container default"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name line"><svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-name-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Code"><path d="M705.28 642.56a35.541333 35.541333 0 0 1 0 70.741333l-3.669333 0.170667H512a35.541333 35.541333 0 0 1 0-71.082667h189.610667l3.626666 0.170667zM297.216 320.9