rimitives</code> — makes <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">import skill_primitives</code> work inside the container</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="" class="">Cache volumes</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">None</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left" class="">Named volumes for <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">pip</code> and <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">uv</code> caches — persists across rebuilds</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">Docker-in-Docker</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Missing</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left" class="">Added for robotics simulators (Isaac Sim, MuJoCo docker, etc.)</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left" class=""><strong data-v-01af594f="">Ruff lint select</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Missing</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left" class="">Explicit <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">["E", "F", "I", "UP", "W"]</code> — matches your CI rules</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">MyPy scope</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">File-level</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left" class="">Workspace-level — catches cross-module type errors</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">MyPy args</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Minimal</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left" class="">Added <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">--ignore-missing-imports</code> and <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">--warn-unused-ignores</code></td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="lef